SAP data and trademarks
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project reads two artifacts published by SAP SE in the Cloudification
Repository (https://github.com/SAP/abap-atc-cr-cv-s4hc, Apache-2.0):

  objectReleaseInfoLatest.json      — object release states
  objectClassifications_SAP.json    — classification of classic APIs

They are synced into lib/abap/generated/ by scripts/sync-cloudification-repo.ts
and remain under their own licence and copyright.

